@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Therapies — list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/therapies

### Therapies — create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/therapies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manual Therapy",
  "slug": "manual-therapy",
  "shortDescription": "Hands-on joint and soft tissue techniques.",
  "description": "Skilled manual techniques to reduce pain and restore mobility.",
  "duration": "40 min sessions",
  "iconKey": "activity"
}

### Appointments — create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Patient",
  "phone": "+911234567890",
  "email": "patient@example.com",
  "preferredDate": "2026-08-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "preferredTime": "10:30 AM",
  "therapyType": "Sports Injury Rehab",
  "message": "First visit"
}

### Appointments — list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments

### Certifications — create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/certifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "BPT Certification",
  "issuer": "Medical Council",
  "imageUrl": "https://placehold.co/400x300/png",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Certifications — list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/certifications

### Testimonials — create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/testimonials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Riya K.",
  "quote": "Dr. Sharma helped me return to running pain-free.",
  "rating": 5
}

### Testimonials — list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/testimonials

### Products — create (v2 stub)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Resistance Band Kit",
  "description": "Home exercise kit",
  "price": 899,
  "isActive": false
}

### Products — list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
